{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0511", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8da370bc669ec90b03ad0829a327cf70b77be9e0d6aeb6b8e55d8ddad52df50d", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThus we may use the following natural definition.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:35322e4680cc43900423677afa805c977a7e233dfb5b517fe59270b0a952b65f", "unit_id": "tag:0511:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0511", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$|\\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Y}|$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n|\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Z}|\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-closed}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d845ac48dbe05d1bf1c8ff6f460f854508cff0972f32d3df8853c4d19c24ab27", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:de091aa891b202167e09a4b57b0dc2c8312c1f82ee80d2fd3e4cadd7d0f8ce47", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> We say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>closed<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if the map of topological\nspaces <MATH_0003> is closed.\n<STRUCT_0003> We say <MATH_0004> is <TEXTITOPEN_0002>universally closed<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if for every morphism\nof algebraic stacks <MATH_0005>\nthe morphism of topological spaces\n<MATH_0006>\nis closed, i.e., the base change\n<MATH_0007> is closed.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:546aa33803b592e857bcb0fd66c21a9a5e74977cedf6507fe34e80e8424d1759", "unit_id": "tag:0513:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0511", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-universally-closed}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d8cd4687aeb732d4af894ec9a8c03997095b14e7234b1a0452ed2df4f52ed433", "source_text": "The base change of a universally closed morphism of algebraic stacks\nby any morphism of algebraic stacks is universally closed.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:34f8e80fbc01995671058049927034551d3aa1f037a23f2ada290586430f7d34", "unit_id": "tag:0514:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0511", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4c9f1d7953f8851709cff930605f61abbbca84d9356e3277b268d2bf55b3f531", "source_text": "This is immediate from the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ed527da30f69c9bcc90112222bdf3d207c927d6febb801818b673598175ce475", "unit_id": "tag:0514:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0511", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-universally-closed}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a0a6771875cb556386d79b3baebea89c3d9ab95f543633b33f0ec01ea7422aaf", "source_text": "The composition of a pair of (universally) closed morphisms of\nalgebraic stacks is (universally) closed.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6c6d9326c80e370aa6c09c37ecf9952a32e365d6b6406f07c23362130ef63ad5", "unit_id": "tag:0515:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0511", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4c9f1d7953f8851709cff930605f61abbbca84d9356e3277b268d2bf55b3f531", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:0515:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0511", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$Z$", "MATH_0004": "$Z \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$|Z \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}| \\to |Z|$", "MATH_0006": "$Z$", "MATH_0007": "$Z \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$|Z \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}| \\to |Z|$", "MATH_0009": "$V$", "MATH_0010": "$V \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0011": "$V \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to V$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-universally-closed-local}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:76cb6b0dee33400c262f8698e92d8b88162bd0af11469acdf631109934e097fa", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b8d4c20ef042ab961d80f025910d728299a1edf7187ebf9bd0ab00535afbad72", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is universally closed,\n<STRUCT_0003> for every scheme <MATH_0003> and every morphism <MATH_0004>\nthe projection <MATH_0005>\nis closed,\n<STRUCT_0004> for every affine scheme <MATH_0006> and every morphism <MATH_0007>\nthe projection <MATH_0008> is\nclosed, and\n<STRUCT_0005> there exists an algebraic space <MATH_0009> and a surjective smooth morphism\n<MATH_0010> such that <MATH_0011>\nis a universally closed morphism of algebraic stacks.\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9a4081757739babdbe00afd9abc0828f52df6d9ffeb8611357ad5d310baeff20", "unit_id": "tag:0CL3:statement"}
